# Knitto React Template — Core

Boilerplate frontend Knitto: React 18, TypeScript, Vite 6, Tailwind CSS v4, Redux Toolkit, RTK Query, React Router, React Hook Form + Zod, `@knittotextile/react-ui`, PNPM.

**Versi minimum:** Node.js >= 24 · pnpm >= 10.34.1

## Struktur proyek

```
src/
├── assets/
├── components/          # shared (layout, ui lokal)
│   └── ui/              # hanya yang belum ada di react-ui
├── lib/                 # utils, hooks, variables
├── pages/               # halaman & sub-halaman (React Router)
│   └── [page]/
│       ├── components/
│       ├── hooks/
│       └── index.tsx
├── redux/               # api/, slice, store.ts
├── styles/              # main.css
├── test/                # setup, mocks, integrations, units
└── types/
config/                  # plugin Vite, deploy
```

## Konvensi penamaan

- File & folder: **kebab-case**
- Komponen React: **PascalCase**
- Variabel & fungsi: **camelCase**
- Konstanta global: **UPPER_CASE**
- Import alias: **`@/*`** → `src/*`

## Perintah

```bash
pnpm dev | build | preview | lint | format:all | test | test:coverage
```

## Do

- TypeScript strict — no `any`
- UI dari `@knittotextile/react-ui` dulu, lokal hanya jika belum ada di lib
- RTK Query untuk semua data fetching; handle loading & error
- ESLint + Prettier
- Hook/logic shared → `src/lib/hooks/`; page-specific → `pages/[page]/hooks/`

## Don't

- npm / yarn (gunakan PNPM)
- fetch/axios langsung
- inline styles
- skip error handling
- duplikasi komponen UI yang sudah ada di lib

